# Managed by Ansible (infra/ansible/roles/firewall). Do not edit by hand.
#
# Accept-all host firewall, on purpose: the OCI security list
# (infra/terraform/network.tf) is the perimeter, and k3s creates and owns its own
# chains at runtime. See rules.v4 for the full explanation. Never save the live
# ruleset into this file.
*filter
:INPUT ACCEPT [0:0]
:FORWARD ACCEPT [0:0]
:OUTPUT ACCEPT [0:0]
COMMIT
